Package: jconfig
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: DIDWW <noc@didww.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/didww/jconfig
Description: Junos configuration backup into git
 Backs up Junos device configurations into a git repository over SSH or
 NETCONF, stores what the device has committed, and commits only what
 actually changed. Ships a Prometheus exporter for answering whether every
 device is still being backed up and whether every backup reaches git.
 .
 The service is installed but not enabled. Write /etc/jconfig/jconfig.yml,
 starting from /etc/jconfig/jconfig.yaml.example, then enable it.
